        <schema:description xml:lang="en">Reusing water from urban waste water treatment plants can help address water scarcity. It can ensure a safe and predictable source of water, whilst lowering the pressure on water bodies and thereby preserving water resources. Farmers can use this water for irrigation, helping the preservation of water resources and adapting to climate change.</schema:description>
