        <cpr:P3 rdf:resource="https://climatepolicyradar.wikibase.cloud/entity/Q1400"/>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">A charge or fee levied on vehicle owners based on the amount of pollutants their vehicle emits, essentially penalizing drivers who use high-emission fuels and encouraging them to switch to cleaner options.</cpr:P7>
