        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Action or measure that increases resilience of societal, cultural and natural heritage to climate change. Climate change and associated heavy precipitation and flooding present serious risks to cultural and natural heritage, including valuable museums, archival collections and areas of valuable natural significance. Increasing resilience of cultural and natural heritage to climate change requires proactive climate adaptation which can reduce deterioration and potential loss while maximising heritage benefits for current and future generations.</cpr:P7>
