        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Crop calendar refers to a schedule that includes key agricultural events such as field preparation dates, sowing/planting dates, emergence, flowering, maturity, and harvest dates, which are influenced by both climate and crop management practices.</cpr:P7>
