        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">reduction of food waste</skos:altLabel>
        <skos:altLabel xml:lang="en">stop food waste</skos:altLabel>
        <cpr:P7 xml:lang="en">Reducing food loss and waste with efficient management practices at the distribution, retail and consumption levels. Measure mainly involve efficient technologies for quality preservation, optimization of transport and supply chains, and awareness-raising.</cpr:P7>
        <schema:description xml:lang="en">Reducing food loss and waste with efficient management practices at the distribution, retail and consumption levels.</schema:description>
